<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-navy dark:text-white">About the Academy</h1>
  <div class="gold-underline w-16 mt-2 mb-6"></div>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-gold mt-8">Our Educational Philosophy</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
    At <%= siteName %>, we believe language should open doors, not create barriers. Our teaching
    is built on <strong>practical communication first</strong>: the English adults actually need for
    work, education, healthcare, family life, and community participation.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
    Every course combines solid <strong>grammar foundations</strong> with <strong>pronunciation practice</strong>,
    <strong>reading comprehension</strong>, <strong>writing skills</strong>, and <strong>listening training</strong> —
    always anchored in real-life situations our students face every day.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-gold mt-8">What We Teach</h2>
  <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-gold font-bold">◆</span> Practical everyday communication and conversation skills</li>
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-gold font-bold">◆</span> Grammar explained clearly, with examples and guided practice</li>
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-gold font-bold">◆</span> Pronunciation, word stress, and intonation — with special attention to the needs of Spanish-speaking learners</li>
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-gold font-bold">◆</span> Reading comprehension with level-appropriate texts</li>
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-gold font-bold">◆</span> Writing for real purposes: messages, emails, forms, essays</li>
    <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-gold font-bold">◆</span> Listening skills for work, school, and daily life</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-gold mt-8">An Inclusive Learning Environment</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
    We welcome students from every country and background. Our courses respect adult learners'
    experience and goals, and many materials include optional Spanish explanations for those who
    benefit from them. Here, your story matters — and your future speaks English.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
    <a href="/courses" class="bg-gold text-navy font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-gold-600 hover:text-white">Explore Our Courses</a>
    <a href="/placement" class="border border-navy dark:border-gold text-navy dark:text-gold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-center font-semibold">Find Your Level</a>
  </div>
</div>
